<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Iberia H1 net profit 5.12 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Iberia H1 net profit 5.12 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish airline</p>
<p>Iberia for first six months of 1997 to June (in</p>
<p>billions of pesetas unless stated).</p>
<p> Net profit		   5.12     vs     1.79 loss</p>
<p> Operating margin	 242.70     up     8.6  pct</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
